🔹 Functional Requirements

*The system must accept PDF documents as input.

*The system must convert PDF pages into images using Poppler.

*The system must extract text from images using Tesseract OCR.

*The system must support multi-page PDFs.

*The system must save extracted text into a .txt file.

*The system must handle missing file errors gracefully.


🔹 Technical Requirements
Programming Language

*Python 3.10.0

Python Libraries

*pytesseract

*pdf2image

*Pillow

*os (built-in)

🔹 External Dependencies 

*Tesseract OCR Engine

Used for Optical Character Recognition.

*Poppler

Used for converting PDF → images
